Project Name: CampOS (It is shortened for campus operating system but can also be pronounced as campos aka "campus")

Tech Stack: Frontend (ReactJs), Backend/Storage(IndexedDB)

Project Description: CampOS is a university management system created for students to better organize their academic and financial activities

Features
- Module Managment: storing and managing modules and assesments
- What-If Calculator: Calculates how much percentage you need to get a certain grade

